  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO Decent Work and Access to Rights in Malawi&apos;s Tobacco Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to address decent work deficits in Malawi&#x2019;s tobacco sector through an integrated approach that will generate new knowledge about the current decent work deficits in the sector; strengthen legal, policy and regulatory frameworks; engages the tripartite constituents in social dialogue; improve working conditions in tobacco growing districts.</narrative>
  </description>
